OL,3,GNEWSAConcern at impact of #162m science
OL,4,Aresearch "cuts"
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of science jobs and the
OL,7,Fclosure of world-leading research
OL,8,Fprogrammes could be at risk, according
OL,9,Fto an MP.
OL,11,FDidcot and Wantage MP, Olly Glover,
OL,12,Fwhose constituency includes Milton
OL,13,FPark, Culham and Harwell science parks,
OL,14,Fhas called for a review of the decision
OL,15,Fto allocate funding away from the
OL,16,FScience and Technology Facilities
OL,17,FCouncil (STFC).
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
