OL,3,GNEWSAConcern at impact of #162m science
OL,4,Aresearch "cuts"
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith increasing running costs, it means
OL,7,Fthe sector, which includes innovation
OL,8,Fin areas including defence and
OL,9,Fsatellite technology, is facing a
OL,10,Ffunding shortfall of #162m.
OL,12,FThe government said funding was
OL,13,Fremaining flat in the current spending
OL,14,Freview but it is "committed to working
OL,15,Fto ensure the UK sustains its
OL,16,Fworld-leading research capabilities."
